From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 08:37:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Weekly Signal shown as issued: scans.content carries the
 signal in its own structure and the scan page shows it as written

- supabase/005_scan_signal.sql adds scans.content (jsonb)
- Manifest: scan.content (weekly-signal-v1) with validation; the importer stores it and never drops it on re-import
- Scan page: when content is present, shows the themes, lead topic, one to watch and article audit log as issued, each FalconBridge Lens set apart; older entries render as before
- Scan list shows the lead headline for as-issued entries; study page link names the Weekly Signal by territory and week
- Admin scan form notes when an entry carries the signal as issued; docs record the rule
